OL,3,APope walking and recovering 'as
OL,4,Aexpected' after surgery, doctors say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV's recovery from surgery to
OL,7,Fremove a lower lobe of his lung is
OL,8,F"progressing as expected", his doctors
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FThe 71-year-old pontiff has started to
OL,12,Fwalk and has "resumed a normal diet"
OL,13,Ffollowing the roughly 90-minute
OL,14,Fprocedure, the medics said in an update
OL,15,Fshared by the Vatican.
OL,17,FThe Pope was diagnosed with lung cancer
OL,18,Fafter the surgery at Rome's Gemelli
OL,19,FHospital on Tuesday afternoon, which
OL,20,Fthe Vatican said had been "successful"
OL,21,Fand proceeded without complications.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
