OL,3,APope walking and recovering 'as
OL,4,Aexpected' after surgery, doctors say
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlood tests and an X-ray early on
OL,7,FWednesday showed his recovery was
OL,8,F"proceeding normally", the doctors
OL,9,Fsaid, and he has also undergone
OL,10,Frespiratory physiotherapy.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
