OL,3,AGermany puts Ukrainian on trial accused
OL,4,Aof blowing up Nord Stream pipelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case is highly sensitive in
OL,7,FGermany, one of Ukraine's closest
OL,8,Fallies since Russia launched its
OL,9,Ffull-scale invasion in February 2022,
OL,10,Fseven months before the attacks took
OL,11,Fplace.
OL,13,FExtradited to Germany last year,
OL,14,FKuznetsov denies the charges, as does a
OL,15,Fsecond suspect who is fighting
OL,16,Fextradition from Croatia.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
